%% Proposed states: reconcile names/transitions with actual product rules.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Uploading: 选择合成材料
  Uploading --> Processing: 字节传输完成
  Uploading --> Recoverable: 中断或失败
  Recoverable --> Uploading: 已确认安全重试
  Processing --> Ready: 服务端确认文件可用
  Processing --> Recoverable: 校验失败
  Ready --> Submitting: 用户正式提交
  Submitting --> Submitted: 服务端确认回执
  Submitting --> Reconcile: 响应丢失或未知
  Reconcile --> Submitted: 查询确认已完成
  Reconcile --> Ready: 查询确认尚未完成
  Submitted --> Submitted: 刷新仍可查到有效回执
